<title>USA: Engle Homes Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Engle Homes Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>In thousands, except share data</p>
<p>				  THREE MONTHS ENDED    YEARS ENDED</p>
<p>					 OCT. 31,	    OCT. 31,</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> REVENUES:		     105,611    70,932  332,088  244,528</p>
<p> COSTS AND EXPENSES:	 100,510    67,517  318,387  234,992</p>
<p> INCOME BEFORE TAX	    5,101     3,415   13,701    9,536</p>
<p>Provision for income taxes</p>
<p>				    1,938     1,298    5,206    3,624</p>
<p> NET INCOME		     3,163     2,117    8,495    5,912</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>  Primary			  0.44	0.30     1.20     0.85</p>
<p>  Fully diluted		  0.38	0.26     1.03     0.74</p>
<p>Shares used in earnings</p>
<p>per share calculations:</p>
<p>  Primary			 7,108     7,022    7,108    6,989</p>
<p>  Fully diluted		 9,251     9,165    9,251    9,132</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
